        "text_68PTnbtAoJ3NpOmO": "<h3>Lio is the flavored air diffuser that makes quitting <strong>simple and enjoyable</strong>. Relief cravings and keep your hand-to-mouth habit—<strong>anytime, anywhere—without nicotine, vapor, or smoke.</strong></h3>",
