        "text_eD3AcXwlH6N3S7e1": "<h3>After two years of hard work, countless improvements, and valuable user feedback, we’re proud to introduce the Lio® Gen 2—a more practical and enjoyable solution.</h3><h3>Unlike the Lio Classic, the Lio® Gen 2 is easier to clean, allowing you to fully savor the flavors.</h3><h3>It also features an adjustable airflow, so you can customize the draw resistance to your liking. You can even close it completely, making your Cores last longer!</h3><h3>And no more fraying the Cores! The Lio® Gen 2 Cores are hollow, meaning no more messy fingers!</h3>",
        "text_VDYPKwh3zduYaw8C": "<h3>IS LIO® HALAL?</h3>",
        "text_8TcMmuZQy1bWL2z9": "<h3>Lio® is free from nicotine, chemicals, and harmful substances, making it a natural, non-electric option. Since it contains no intoxicants or prohibited ingredients, <strong>Lio® aligns with Halal practices</strong>. However, always consult with a religious authority if you have concerns.</h3>",
        "text_0UcQx7evspO1Z51u": "<h3>IS LIO® SAFE?</h3>",
        "text_pTuihhH4aQypDGns": "<h3><strong>Safety first, always</strong>! Every natural plant compound in our products goes through serious third-party testing. These tests (plus a bunch of studies) prove that what you&apos;re inhaling is <strong>safe and effective</strong>. We&apos;re all about research to make sure you get a reliable, natural, non-electric option that keeps you healthy without skimping on safety or results.</h3>",
        "text_oMDEvU9EcJ0jwh9N": "<h3>WHAT&apos;S IN A STARTERPACK?</h3>",
        "text_SdgoiUxkxDQIMRN4": "<h3>Sicherheit geht immer vor! Jeder natürliche Pflanzenextrakt in unseren Produkten wird strengen Tests durch Dritte unterzogen. Diese Tests (und zahlreiche Studien) beweisen, dass das, was Sie inhalieren, sicher und wirksam ist. Wir engagieren uns in der Forschung, um sicherzustellen, dass Sie eine zuverlässige, natürliche, nicht elektrische Option erhalten, die Sie gesund hält, ohne Kompromisse bei Sicherheit oder Ergebnissen einzugehen.</h3>",
        "text_S7klQxOeDrE00Ov9": "<h3>DIFFERENCE CLASSIC &amp; GEN 2 </h3>",
        "text_4bBLxJj810Y98rFb": "<h3>After two years of hard work, countless improvements, and valuable user feedback, we’re proud to introduce the Lio® Gen 2—a more practical and enjoyable solution.</h3><h3>Unlike the Lio Classic, the Lio® Gen 2 is easier to clean, allowing you to fully savor the flavors.</h3><h3>It also features an adjustable airflow, so you can customize the draw resistance to your liking. You can even close it completely, making your Cores last longer!</h3><h3>And no more fraying the Cores! The Lio® Gen 2 Cores are hollow, meaning no more messy fingers!</h3>",
